# Optional. Market data works without any of this -- every chain, candle and
# ticker endpoint the desk reads is public.
#
# Set these only to see your own balances and positions. Use a NEW key with
# read-only permissions; do not reuse a key that has ever been pasted into a
# chat, a screenshot, or a file in this repo.
